WEBVTT

00:01.310 --> 00:05.940
This country has many outstanding 
doctors, doesn't it?

00:05.940 --> 00:09.100
You are the only one who 
can become its empress.

00:09.850 --> 00:14.870
And you can understand which of the two is 
more important to the country, can't you?

00:16.790 --> 00:20.070
It isn't as if you have grown 
to hate my son, is it?

00:20.380 --> 00:24.870
I heard that earlier you performed a 
dance together in perfect harmony.

00:26.650 --> 00:30.330
What do you think? Won't you reconsider?

00:31.300 --> 00:34.040
<i>I understand what His Majesty is saying.</i>

00:35.010 --> 00:36.990
<i>Even so, I still...</i>

00:39.510 --> 00:42.170
I have no intention of 
ending the wager here!

00:51.040 --> 00:51.870
Please, come in!

00:53.590 --> 00:55.450
I knew it. You're still awake.

00:55.450 --> 00:58.570
Yes. I wanted to prepare for the exam.

00:59.100 --> 01:01.600
Lise, you're pushing yourself 
a little too hard.

01:01.600 --> 01:03.620
The birthday celebrations continue tomorrow.

01:03.620 --> 01:06.470
You have an early morning, 
so you need to go to sleep.

01:06.740 --> 01:09.710
What? But I'm still in the 
middle of my studies.

01:09.710 --> 01:12.110
Do that later.

01:12.110 --> 01:13.460
Come on. Go to sleep!

01:14.980 --> 01:16.750
<i>Doesn't look like I'll 
get anymore done today.</i>

02:56.520 --> 02:58.510
Lady Clorence!

02:59.310 --> 03:01.390
My congratulations on this occasion.

03:01.860 --> 03:03.040
Thank you.

03:03.040 --> 03:05.500
My, what a lovely person you are.

03:05.500 --> 03:08.980
I was certain that His 
Majesty would choose you.

03:08.980 --> 03:11.180
Oh, um...

03:12.300 --> 03:14.970
<i>After hearing His Majesty's 
announcement yesterday,</i>

03:14.970 --> 03:18.010
<i>it's only natural that they'd think 
I was the prince's fiancée.</i>

03:18.450 --> 03:20.660
<i>Oh, that's right! Juliane...</i>

03:25.740 --> 03:30.290
E-Excuse me, do you know if the young 
lady from the House of Child is here?

03:30.290 --> 03:33.320
No, I haven't seen her.

03:33.320 --> 03:34.690
I see.

03:35.380 --> 03:40.690
<i>Juliane is in love with the prince, so the 
announcement must have come as a shock.</i>

03:41.190 --> 03:43.490
<i>And just when we'd become friends...</i>

03:44.230 --> 03:46.350
<i>I'd like to see her and 
explain things properly.</i>

03:48.600 --> 03:51.340
Help! Someone call for a doctor!

03:51.340 --> 03:53.370
Duchess Harbour has collapsed!

03:53.370 --> 03:55.350
Duchess Harbour!

03:57.190 --> 03:58.420
Excuse me!

03:59.190 --> 04:00.420
Please pardon me.

04:00.820 --> 04:02.470
Lady Clorence?

04:05.720 --> 04:08.690
<i>Difficulty swallowing is often 
seen in Parkinson's cases.</i>

04:08.690 --> 04:11.740
<i>It's likely that some food from the party 
is lodged in her respiratory tract.</i>

04:12.210 --> 04:15.470
Your Grace, wake up! Duchess Harbour!

04:16.320 --> 04:17.680
<i>She's unconscious.</i>

04:17.680 --> 04:19.820
<i>And she's exhibiting cyanosis!</i>

04:26.340 --> 04:28.190
<i>The Heimlich maneuver isn't working.</i>

04:29.040 --> 04:31.660
<i>That means there's only one method left.</i>

04:32.710 --> 04:37.570
<i>I'm glad that I carry an alcohol-based 
antiseptic with me to prevent infection.</i>

04:40.390 --> 04:42.290
Wh-What are you doing?!

04:42.290 --> 04:45.740
If you care for the duchess's well-being, 
then please don't interfere!

04:49.520 --> 04:51.340
I promise I can save her!

04:57.230 --> 05:00.770
<i>I'll make an incision in her 
neck to secure her airway.</i>

05:00.770 --> 05:03.240
<i>I need to complete this within 
thirty seconds.</i>

05:08.610 --> 05:12.270
<i>Good. I can just barely see 
some food lodged in there.</i>

05:12.270 --> 05:14.360
<i>Now, I'll use this tube to...</i>

05:21.180 --> 05:24.220
She's all right. I'm so glad!

05:29.350 --> 05:33.560
<i>There isn't any precedent of performing 
a tracheotomy in this world,</i>

05:34.230 --> 05:36.500
<i>so this is likely to 
become a serious matter.</i>

05:36.500 --> 05:37.820
Lady Clorence.

05:40.300 --> 05:42.060
If you will come with us.

05:42.720 --> 05:48.030
I understand. But first, may I 
ask that a message be delivered?

05:48.030 --> 05:49.520
A message?

05:49.520 --> 05:51.910
Yes. As the situation was urgent,

05:51.910 --> 05:55.290
I didn't move her to an operating room 
before performing this treatment.

05:55.800 --> 05:59.330
The disinfection wasn't performed 
under ideal circumstances,

05:59.730 --> 06:01.760
so there is a risk of infection.

06:02.670 --> 06:07.990
Please tell the staff at Imperial Cross 
Hospital to disinfect the region again.

06:08.460 --> 06:10.460
O-Of course.

06:10.460 --> 06:12.050
I'm entrusting this to you.

06:24.020 --> 06:27.730
It seems that Duchess Harbour 
has been saved from death.

06:27.730 --> 06:33.070
I see. We must give our 
gratitude to Lady Clorence.

06:33.070 --> 06:38.240
As Your Majesty commanded, the young lady 
has been entrusted to the Hundreds House.

06:38.540 --> 06:43.740
Yes, well, we can't put the 
lady in a jail cell, can we?

06:43.740 --> 06:48.120
Your Majesty, I believe this situation 
is likely to prove tricky.

06:48.760 --> 06:50.390
By which you mean?

06:50.390 --> 06:56.380
This incident will greatly increase 
her reputation as a doctor.

06:56.380 --> 06:57.970
Indeed.

06:57.970 --> 07:01.500
She did, after all, save the duchess, 
who is a part of the imperial family.

07:01.500 --> 07:04.430
We may even award her a medal for it.

07:04.430 --> 07:08.500
If that happens, then her 
desire to become a doctor

07:08.500 --> 07:10.990
is likely to be supported by public opinion.

07:10.990 --> 07:14.240
Yes, that's true.

07:15.000 --> 07:17.770
And so, I have a suggestion.

07:17.770 --> 07:22.790
What do you think of keeping the lady 
quietly confined to the Hundreds House

07:23.280 --> 07:25.750
until the physician's exam is over?

07:26.690 --> 07:29.630
We can't do that.

07:29.630 --> 07:33.550
We couldn't keep her confined 
for that length of time.

07:33.550 --> 07:37.870
It's likely that the lady's 
treatment wasn't perfect.

07:37.870 --> 07:42.620
If we investigate thoroughly, we should 
be able to find some small mistake.

07:43.150 --> 07:48.610
If I remember correctly, she performed the 
procedure with a knife meant for eating.

07:48.610 --> 07:49.400
Very well.

07:49.820 --> 07:54.700
Sir Vent, gather all of the 
finest doctors in the empire.

07:54.700 --> 07:57.420
Begin the investigation immediately.

07:57.660 --> 07:58.330
Sire!

08:03.410 --> 08:06.470
Lise, why did you do 
something so dangerous?!

08:06.740 --> 08:09.210
Father and I have been so worried!

08:10.040 --> 08:13.220
I'm sorry, Chris.

08:13.520 --> 08:15.810
Are you truly repentant?

08:15.810 --> 08:19.480
How could you suddenly cut the 
duchess's neck with a knife?

08:19.480 --> 08:22.390
His Majesty's personal intervention means

08:22.390 --> 08:24.850
you've only been confined 
to the Hundreds House,

08:24.850 --> 08:28.240
but you'd have typically been 
thrown right into prison!

08:29.180 --> 08:30.990
I'm sorry.

08:32.110 --> 08:33.930
As long as you understand.

08:33.930 --> 08:37.810
Now, Lise, if something similar were 
to happen again, what would you do?

08:37.810 --> 08:39.990
Could you behave yourself as you should?

08:40.320 --> 08:42.820
If there's a patient in front 
of me, I will save them!

08:43.330 --> 08:45.830
It seems you need more scolding, then.

08:47.320 --> 08:48.480
Elise.

08:49.340 --> 08:55.790
Chris and I understand that you acted as 
you did in order to save the duchess.

08:56.250 --> 08:59.550
<i>Ren... He isn't angry?</i>

09:00.070 --> 09:01.640
And it isn't just me.

09:02.070 --> 09:08.020
Anyone would praise your giving of 
medical treatment as an act of bravery.

09:09.950 --> 09:12.370
But that and this are two different issues!

09:12.650 --> 09:15.290
Saving the duchess is admirable!

09:15.290 --> 09:18.910
But it isn't a good reason for 
you to endanger yourself, Lise!

09:19.340 --> 09:20.910
Y-Yes.

09:21.340 --> 09:27.530
Are you really sorry? Lise, you 
always act too impulsively!

09:22.070 --> 09:27.310
<i>Ren praised me, and 
Chris is yelling at me...</i>

09:27.310 --> 09:29.580
<i>This is the opposite of how 
things usually turn out.</i>

09:27.970 --> 09:29.900
You need to think about...

09:38.070 --> 09:41.540
<i>I need to reread Grantham's essays.</i>

09:41.540 --> 09:44.840
<i>And I should read Fleming's 
medical text, too.</i>

09:47.660 --> 09:54.350
The observable symptoms of acute 
intestinal ischemia are...

10:03.370 --> 10:07.340
My dear sister, there's something I'd 
like to speak with you about.

10:08.380 --> 10:09.580
What is it?

10:11.280 --> 10:14.720
It's nothing. Take care of yourself.

10:20.020 --> 10:21.190
No.

10:21.780 --> 10:23.590
Wait, Mil!

10:23.590 --> 10:25.100
Mil!

10:26.300 --> 10:27.460
No...

10:28.230 --> 10:31.310
Please... You can't die.

10:35.600 --> 10:38.910
I heard she'd been taken into custody, 
so I came to see how she was faring...

10:38.910 --> 10:41.150
What sort of dream could she be having?

10:44.870 --> 10:45.990
<i>Don't cry.</i>

10:46.640 --> 10:49.370
<i>When I see you suffering...</i>

10:49.890 --> 10:52.520
<i>I don't know why, but something 
in my chest tightens.</i>

10:57.370 --> 11:00.620
<i>It's painful enough to make me break my vow</i>

11:01.120 --> 11:03.820
<i>never to return to this tower of blood.</i>

11:11.990 --> 11:14.920
Elise, I hope you will 
dream of pleasant things.

11:23.620 --> 11:27.550
Well, I never imagined that older 
brother of mine would...

11:34.900 --> 11:40.160
<i>Elise. The fiancée my brother 
has expressed an interest in.</i>

11:40.160 --> 11:42.510
<i>Maybe I'll go and tease her a little.</i>

11:47.500 --> 11:50.760
My dear sister, what are you reading?

11:51.580 --> 11:52.780
Whoops!

11:54.680 --> 11:58.310
Apologies. This is the first time 
we've spoken like this, isn't it?

11:59.070 --> 12:03.700
I'm Linden de Romanoff's little 
brother, the third prince, Mikhail.

12:03.700 --> 12:06.400
It's an honor to meet you, dear sister.

12:06.850 --> 12:11.300
Or, perhaps you'd rather not have met my 
brother's political opponent face-to-face?

12:11.920 --> 12:15.650
<i>Now, what will you do? Will you 
be dumbfounded with shock?</i>

12:15.650 --> 12:18.840
<i>Or, will you hide your true 
feelings and force a smile?</i>

12:18.840 --> 12:19.590
Mil...

12:19.590 --> 12:20.290
Huh?

12:21.030 --> 12:25.300
Mil... Mil, is that really you?

12:25.300 --> 12:28.680
<i>Mil? How does she know that nickname?</i>

12:29.300 --> 12:31.080
Oh, um...

12:31.690 --> 12:34.970
I-I'm terribly sorry, Your Highness.

12:34.970 --> 12:36.560
Please, don't mind me.

12:37.770 --> 12:40.570
Allow me to introduce myself.

12:40.570 --> 12:43.540
I am Elise, from the Clorence family.

12:43.540 --> 12:45.580
Nice to meet you, Elise.

12:48.260 --> 12:49.770
<i>I don't understand it.</i>

12:50.220 --> 12:55.070
<i>When this girl looks at me, I see 
a kind of sorrow in her eyes.</i>

12:55.730 --> 13:00.090
I only came to offer you my 
greetings today, so I'll go now.

13:00.090 --> 13:01.720
Of course, Your Highness.

13:01.720 --> 13:06.980
I'll come again. After all, I've been 
locked in this tower with nothing to do.

13:06.980 --> 13:08.730
Locked in?

13:08.730 --> 13:10.380
Did you do something?

13:10.730 --> 13:14.220
They'd prepared beverages for His 
Majesty's birthday celebrations.

13:14.220 --> 13:17.040
I borrowed just a tiny bit and got caught.

13:17.040 --> 13:20.400
I got tossed in here and told 
to reflect on my actions.

13:20.400 --> 13:23.980
Your Highness, you don't 
seem repentant at all.

13:23.980 --> 13:24.910
You don't think so?

13:25.290 --> 13:27.860
Well, I'll see you later, dear sister.

13:33.730 --> 13:37.920
Now, let's hear the results 
of the investigation.

13:37.920 --> 13:39.000
Sire.

13:39.530 --> 13:44.510
To start with our conclusion, it was 
truly an impeccable medical treatment.

13:44.510 --> 13:46.320
Wh-What?

13:46.320 --> 13:48.640
She stabbed the duchess's 
throat with a knife!

13:48.640 --> 13:50.970
You call that impeccable?

13:50.970 --> 13:52.740
Yes, indeed!

13:52.740 --> 13:58.860
The treatment performed in this case is very 
dangerous, so no one has been able to test it!

13:59.180 --> 14:06.070
But the lady used her transcendent skills 
and anatomical knowledge to succeed perfectly!

14:06.980 --> 14:09.110
It wasn't simply by chance?

14:09.110 --> 14:10.060
That's right.

14:10.060 --> 14:14.840
In her written statement, she provided 
the details of the treatment.

14:14.840 --> 14:17.810
And it's absolutely magnificent!

14:17.810 --> 14:23.620
The positioning and method of the incision 
was optimal and described very precisely.

14:23.930 --> 14:28.890
To advance medical science, I believe her 
statement should be published as a treatise!

14:29.600 --> 14:35.380
I see. And what do you think, 
Doctor Graham de Fallon?

14:35.380 --> 14:38.540
Sire, by your leave, I will give my opinion.

14:38.990 --> 14:41.440
I would say that the empire's medical community

14:41.440 --> 14:44.140
has gained another extraordinary genius.

14:45.630 --> 14:47.660
You'd go that far?

14:47.660 --> 14:48.700
Yes, sire.

14:49.190 --> 14:52.030
The lady's treatment was absolutely perfect.

14:52.030 --> 14:54.520
I would stake my reputation 
as a doctor on it.

14:55.010 --> 14:58.490
Very well. Thank you for your report.

14:58.950 --> 15:05.270
Sir Vent, tell the Hundreds House to 
release the lady immediately.

15:05.270 --> 15:07.550
Are you certain, Your Majesty?

15:07.550 --> 15:08.740
Yes.

15:09.300 --> 15:13.310
Incidentally, Your Highness, 
I have a favor to ask of you.

15:13.310 --> 15:15.690
What is it? Tell me.

15:15.690 --> 15:19.920
Will you allow me to meet Lady Clorence?

15:19.920 --> 15:24.180
I would like to discuss this 
most recent case with the lady!

15:24.590 --> 15:27.430
Well, you may do as you like.

15:28.000 --> 15:29.850
Thank you so much!

15:36.100 --> 15:37.090
Come in!

15:38.240 --> 15:40.090
Good morning, dear sister!

15:40.090 --> 15:44.340
Your Highness! You shouldn't walk around 
so much while you're being disciplined.

15:44.340 --> 15:48.060
What? But I'm bored. 
Spend some time with me.

15:48.060 --> 15:50.630
Honestly, you are hopeless.

15:50.630 --> 15:52.940
You're reading again today?

15:53.490 --> 15:56.090
I'm amazed you can read 
such a complicated book.

15:56.430 --> 16:00.360
I have to pass the exam and become a doctor.

16:00.620 --> 16:04.430
That means you wouldn't marry 
my brother, doesn't it?

16:05.240 --> 16:06.970
I do intend not to.

16:08.300 --> 16:13.260
Which is why, Your Highness, instead of 
calling me your sister, please call me Elise...

16:13.260 --> 16:15.530
or you could even call me Lise.

16:15.530 --> 16:17.450
All right, Lise.

16:18.390 --> 16:20.910
So, when will you be finished studying?

16:21.480 --> 16:24.160
I won't be finished today.

16:24.160 --> 16:26.280
Lise, you're so serious.

16:26.280 --> 16:30.380
Why don't you find a random stopping 
point and have a drink with me today?

16:30.380 --> 16:32.160
Oh, I couldn't.

16:32.780 --> 16:34.890
Just a little break couldn't hurt!

16:34.890 --> 16:38.730
I had some special sweets brought 
in from the Republic of Fresgard!

16:39.010 --> 16:40.760
Sweets?

16:42.590 --> 16:45.260
Oh, it's such a shame!

16:45.260 --> 16:48.620
The sweets from Fresgard are exquisite!

16:48.620 --> 16:52.850
But if you say you don't want them, Lise, 
then I suppose there's no helping it.

16:55.550 --> 16:57.500
Just for a little while, then.

16:57.500 --> 16:59.290
That's more like it!

17:04.800 --> 17:06.890
Now, drink up! Drink up!

17:07.970 --> 17:12.180
This is the prized cordial of 
my father's that I borrowed.

17:12.180 --> 17:14.830
There's no alcohol in it, so 
there's no need to worry.

17:15.220 --> 17:17.720
It isn't good to steal 
things, Your Highness.

17:18.070 --> 17:21.790
If you keep doing things like this, you'll 
never be able to leave this place.

17:22.200 --> 17:26.160
If that means living here with you, 
Lise, then that wouldn't be so bad.

17:26.160 --> 17:32.400
I already know that you say those things 
 to every girl you speak with, Your Highness.

17:33.760 --> 17:35.600
Whatever do you mean?

17:35.600 --> 17:38.030
Now, shall we have a toast?

17:38.030 --> 17:41.580
To my father's frustrated face at not 
having the chance to drink this!

17:41.580 --> 17:42.370
Cheers!

17:44.490 --> 17:46.040
<i>This brings back memories.</i>

17:46.470 --> 17:49.410
<i>We used to toast like this 
all the time, didn't we?</i>

17:50.180 --> 17:53.920
Wait, Mil! Mil!

17:54.970 --> 17:58.720
<i>Before, I wasn't able 
to prevent Mil's death.</i>

18:00.060 --> 18:02.050
<i>Their Highnesses Mil and Linden.</i>

18:02.050 --> 18:05.650
<i>They're both princes, but 
only one can become emperor.</i>

18:06.610 --> 18:10.710
<i>If Mil would give up on the throne, 
he might be able to be saved,</i>

18:10.710 --> 18:12.650
<i>but that won't ever happen, will it?</i>

18:13.390 --> 18:15.690
Lise? Are you all right?

18:15.970 --> 18:18.450
Oh! I'm sorry.

18:18.450 --> 18:22.520
Lise, you always make that 
expression when you look at me.

18:23.770 --> 18:27.540
It's like you've already experienced 
life many times before.

18:27.540 --> 18:28.830
What?

18:31.060 --> 18:34.960
There's no need to be so shocked, 
is there? I'm just joking!

18:37.930 --> 18:40.560
<i>Th-That's Mil for you.</i>

18:40.560 --> 18:42.090
<i>His instincts are very sharp.</i>

18:42.470 --> 18:46.470
Still, you really have changed, Lise.

18:46.470 --> 18:49.970
To think you'd cast aside the position 
of empress to become a doctor...

18:50.630 --> 18:52.970
Do you hate my brother that much?

18:52.970 --> 18:55.240
No, that's not it at all.

18:55.240 --> 18:56.450
Then, why?

18:58.610 --> 19:01.850
Your Highness, you're a master 
of the sword, aren't you?

19:02.530 --> 19:06.010
You've even traveled to other 
countries to train as a warrior.

19:06.010 --> 19:07.860
Yes, that's true.

19:08.160 --> 19:10.500
I shouldn't say it about myself,

19:10.500 --> 19:13.370
but I don't think anyone can 
beat me at swordsmanship.

19:13.810 --> 19:17.250
Why did you choose to hone your sword work?

19:17.250 --> 19:20.870
As a member of the imperial family, 
you shouldn't need sword skills.

19:21.160 --> 19:22.580
Well...

19:23.440 --> 19:25.890
I suppose it's because I love the sword.

19:25.890 --> 19:27.360
I'm the same.

19:29.910 --> 19:35.400
<i>At the beginning, I chose the work in order 
to atone for the mistakes of my first life.</i>

19:35.820 --> 19:37.110
<i>But now...</i>

19:39.780 --> 19:44.490
I want to spend my life carrying 
out the work of a doctor.

19:45.740 --> 19:49.570
My father intends for you 
to marry my brother.

19:50.090 --> 19:52.330
Once that happens, you won't 
be able to become a doctor.

19:54.110 --> 19:55.500
If that happens...

19:56.490 --> 20:01.050
If that happens, then I think I'll simply 
sing an unending song of lament.

20:02.320 --> 20:06.940
Like a bird who's had its wings 
clipped and been locked in a cage.

20:08.950 --> 20:13.540
<i>That's why I must win my 
wager with His Majesty.</i>

20:30.320 --> 20:32.830
A bird in a cage, is it?

20:35.300 --> 20:41.060
If I were my brother, I'd treat 
Lise with so much more care.

20:55.320 --> 21:00.600
I wanted to stay trapped here a little 
longer, but I have to leave tomorrow.

21:02.650 --> 21:04.710
I'll see you again, my lady.

21:09.840 --> 21:11.830
Oh, I can't wait!

21:11.830 --> 21:16.440
Who'd have imagined that Lady Elise was 
hiding such outstanding abilities!

21:16.440 --> 21:19.910
I'm so looking forward to seeing her!
 Aren't you, Professor Graham?

21:19.910 --> 21:20.690
Yes.

21:21.740 --> 21:26.560
<i>If Lady Clorence truly did 
perform that treatment,</i>

21:27.330 --> 21:30.600
<i>then she may posses abilities 
equal to Rose's.</i>

21:35.660 --> 21:37.490
I must have fallen asleep.

21:38.490 --> 21:41.100
I wonder if Mil carried me to bed.

21:43.970 --> 21:47.160
My lady, there are visitors here to see you.

21:48.270 --> 21:50.230
Is it my brothers?

21:50.730 --> 21:51.950
Please, come in!

21:55.840 --> 21:56.960
Why?

21:57.720 --> 22:00.350
What are you doing here, Rose?

22:01.350 --> 22:04.090
D-Doctor Graham?

22:06.220 --> 22:09.970
Reminiscence
